*.npy


# === TDP-87 — model and training artifacts ===
# *.pt and *.png are ignored globally above, but we explicitly commit:
# - the trained classifier (small, ~0.25 MB, deliverable)
# - the metadata sidecar
# - the training curves figure (deliverable for client meeting)
!ai-model/models/*.pt
!ai-model/models/*.json
!ai-model/notebooks/*.png

# === TDP-88 — evaluation artifacts ===
# Re-enter the outputs/ tree, ignore everything inside, then allow evaluation/
!ai-model/outputs/
ai-model/outputs/*
!ai-model/outputs/evaluation/
!ai-model/outputs/evaluation/*.png
!ai-model/outputs/evaluation/*.json